The 23 engineering-principle skills under skills/principle-attack-the-premise
through skills/principle-type-system-discipline (all skill directories whose
names begin with "principle-", except the eight Salesforce-native principles
listed in the README) are vendored verbatim from pstack:
https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack (commit f5bdd68).
pstack is authored by Lauren Tan (@poteto) and licensed under the MIT
License above. The eight Salesforce-native principles and all sf-* skills
are original to sfstack and licensed under this repo's root LICENSE.
